### Cycle (alias: `cy`)

Requires: `--workspace`, `--project`

```bash
plane cycle list
plane cycle get <cycle-id>
plane cycle create --name "Sprint 1" [--description "..."] [--start-date 2024-01-01] [--end-date 2024-01-14]
plane cycle update <cycle-id> [--name "..."] [--start-date ...] [--end-date ...]
plane cycle delete <cycle-id>

# Work item management
plane cycle list-items <cycle-id>
plane cycle add-items <cycle-id> --items <id1>,<id2>
plane cycle remove-item <cycle-id> <item-id>

# Lifecycle
plane cycle transfer <cycle-id> --new-cycle <target-cycle-id>
plane cycle archive <cycle-id>
plane cycle unarchive <cycle-id>
```

